  "transcript": "I have a bachelor’s degree in Informatics from the University of Skövde, comprising one hundred and eighty university credits.\n\nThe degree combined transferred studies from Estonia with additional coursework in Sweden.\n\nMy thesis explored email classification using Latent Dirichlet Allocation and a Random Forest classifier. I investigated how additional information affected classification accuracy.\n\nMy courses included software testing, algorithms and data structures, systems thinking, quantitative methods, and English.",
